        {
          "text": "Walakini miili yetu ni kama miili ya ndugu zetu, na watoto wetu kama watoto wao; kumbe! Mnawatia utumwani wana wetu na binti zetu kuwa watumishi, na baadhi ya binti zetu wamekwisha kutiwa utumwani; wala hatuwezi kujiepusha na hayo; maana watu wengine wana mashamba yetu na mizabibu yetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.5"
            ]
